                  "description": {
                    "value": "You interfere with the target's ability to teleport and travel between dimensions. Dimensional anchor attempts to counteract any teleportation effect, or any effect that would move the target to a different plane. The duration is determined by the target's Will save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The effect's duration is 1 minute.\n- **Failure:** The effect's duration is 10 minutes.\n- **Critical Failure:** The effect's duration is 1 hour."
